          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Google's $15B AI Data Centre in Visakhapatnam to Make India a Premier AI Hub in Asia",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "Andhra Pradesh Chief Minister N Chandrababu Naidu will officially unveil Google's $15 billion AI data centre project in Visakhapatnam on April 28, 2026. The facility will carry a capacity of 1 gigawatt, one of the largest single AI infrastructure investments ever announced in Asia. The project is positioned to transform Visakhapatnam into a technology and AI hub with significant implications for jobs, digital infrastructure, and India's standing in the global AI race.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/artificial-intelligence/andhra-cm-naidu-to-launch-google-ai-data-centre-project-in-visakhapatnam/articleshow/130542451.cms",
            "publisher": {
